---
description: Apply EngineeringSpec contracts during consequential engineering changes
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow @AGENTS.md.

Use the shared lifecycle: explore, propose, approve, implement, verify, close. Before modifying code, locate the base-pinned approved contract and inspect affected paths. Treat contracts and constraints as binding. Before ending a turn, run `engineeringspec check --spec-dir docs/engineering-specs --base origin/main --strict`; it checks the complete working state. Fix or escalate violations. Widen approved targets in a contract-only change before implementing against them. Specification-declared runners are inert.
